  <h2 class="kd-h2" id="games">Play a history game</h2>
  <p class="kd-sub">Games with real pictures and real dates, and a new crossword and quiz every day. The games start on Easy, and you can make them harder whenever you like.</p>
  <ul class="kd-games">
    <li><a class="kd-game" href="/games#pairs"><span class="kd-game-ic" aria-hidden="true">&#10022;</span><b>Emblem Pairs</b><span>Turn the cards and match the flags and coats of arms.</span></a></li>
    <li><a class="kd-game" href="/games#order"><span class="kd-game-ic" aria-hidden="true">&#8645;</span><b>Order the Ages</b><span>Put famous moments in the right order.</span></a></li>
    <li><a class="kd-game" href="/games#ranks"><span class="kd-game-ic" aria-hidden="true">&#9650;</span><b>Order the Ranks</b><span>Who was above whom? Put the ranks in order.</span></a></li>
    <li><a class="kd-game" href="/games#hunt"><span class="kd-game-ic" aria-hidden="true">&#9673;</span><b>Globe Hunt</b><span>Spin the globe and find where it was.</span></a></li>
