" href="#t-china"><span class="kd-door-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/great-wall-of-china.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="kd-door-t">Ancient China</span><span class="kd-door-n">10 to explore</span></a></li><li><a class="kd-door" href="#t-africa"><span class="kd-door-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/great-zimbabwe.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="kd-door-t">Africa's Great Kingdoms</span><span class="kd-door-n">9 to explore</span></a></li><li><a class="kd-door" href="#t-americas"><span class="kd-door-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/machu-picchu.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="kd-door-t">Aztecs, Maya and Inca</span><span class="kd-door-n">8 to explore</span></a></li><li><a class="kd-door" href="#t-pacific"><span class="kd-door-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/easter-island.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="kd-door-t">Islands and Ocean Voyagers</span><span class="kd-door-n">9 to explore</span></a></li><li><a class="kd-door" href="#t-india"><span class="kd-door-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/konark-sun-temple.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="kd-door-t">India's Golden Ages</span><span class="kd-door-n">10 to explore</span></a></li><li><a class="kd-door" href="#t-islamic"><span class="kd-door-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/house-of-wisdom.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="kd-door-t">The Islamic Golden Age</span><span class="kd-door-n">11 to explore</span></a></li><li><a class="kd-door" href="#t-japan"><span class="kd-door-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/mount-fuji.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="kd-door-t">Samurai and Old Japan</span><span class="kd-door-n">8 to explore</span></a></li><li><a class="kd-door" href="#t-mesopotamia"><span class="kd-door-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/ishtar-gate.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="kd-door-t">Ancient Mesopotamia</span><span class="kd-door-n">10 to explore</span></a></li></ul>
